pub const HELP: &str = "bzz keys\n\nNormal\n  j/k, gg/G       navigate\n  Ctrl-u/Ctrl-d   half page\n  Ctrl-p/Ctrl-t   channel finder\n  / / I            search / Inbox\n  Ctrl-n           new workspace DM\n  H / A            hide DM / add participant\n  Ctrl-y           theme picker\n  Ctrl-b           sidebar\n  Ctrl-] / Enter   thread/open\n  i / p            compose/preview media\n  r / D / U        react/delete/mark unread\n  1–9              community\n  : / ? / Q        command/help/quit\n\nInbox\n  j/k, f           navigate / cycle filter\n  Enter / Esc      detail / back\n  o / i            open / open and reply\n  m / U / a        read / local unread / all loaded read\n\nSearch\n  type             search channels, DMs, people, messages\n  Up/Down, Enter   select and open\n  from: in:        author and channel operators\n  after: before:   UTC date operators (YYYY-MM-DD)\n\nWorkspace DMs\n  type, Up/Down    filter people\n  Space / Enter    select / open\n  DMs are relay-private workspace channels, not end-to-end encrypted.\n\nTheme picker\n  type, j/k        filter and preview\n  Tab / Enter      scope/save\n  Esc              restore previous theme\n\nMedia preview\n  [ / ]            previous/next attachment\n  Enter            reveal spoiler\n  r / s / Esc      retry/save/close\n\nComposer\n  Ctrl-a/Ctrl-r/x  attach/retry/remove file\n  Enter            send\n  Alt-Enter/Ctrl-j newline\n  Esc              save draft and return\n\nCommands\n  :inbox / :search open Inbox / search\n  :dm / :dm hide   open / hide workspace DM\n  :dm add           add participant via a new DM\n  :theme reload    reload theme.toml\n  :media reload    rebuild media renderer\n\nCLI media\n  bzz media status\n  bzz media clear --all --yes\n";
